        "![commutator subgroup](./commutator.png)\n",
        "\n",
        "We can iterate this process and look at the commutator of the commutator, and so\n",
        "on. This gives us the *derived series* of a group:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\begin{align*}\n",
        "G^{(0)} &= G \\\\\n",
        "G^{(1)} &= [G,G] \\\\\n",
        "G^{(2)} &= [G^{(1)}, G^{(1)}] \\\\\n",
        "&\\vdots\n",
        "\\end{align*}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "This iterated structure can be visualized as follows:\n",
